 "codigo": "CL052",
 "parte": 1,
 "titulo": "Too ugly to be rewarded, so he became the demon king 👹 Zhong Kui Part 1 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "TOO UGLY TO WIN",
 "descripcion": "Zhong Kui came first in the imperial exam. Then the Emperor saw his face. What happened next on the palace steps turned a scholar into China's most feared demon hunter.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWas the Emperor right to judge him by his face?\n\nFrom the Chinese legend of Zhong Kui, as recorded by Shen Kuo in Mengxi Bitan (11th century) and in later Ming-era versions.\n#zhongkui #chinesemythology #mythology #ancientchina #shorts",
 "visual": "ilustrado",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "He came *first* in all of China, and lost everything because of his face.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-escada-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.75,
      1.6
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.15,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "His name was Zhong Kui, a scholar from the Zhongnan Mountains.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "aldeia_china-templo",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.08,
      1.0
     ],
     "x": 0.38,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "andar",
      "rosto": "calmo",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": [
       0.3,
       0.5
      ]
     }
    ],
    "cartao": {
     "tipo": "nome",
     "titulo": "Zhong Kui",
     "sub": "scholar of the Zhongnan Mountains",
     "t0": 0.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Huge, dark, with a wild beard and eyes like fire.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "aldeia_china-praca",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.45,
      1.6
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "But nobody in the empire wrote better than him.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "aldeia_china-casa-noite",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
      1.45
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "escuro"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "calmo",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the exam was the only door out of poverty.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "aldeia_china-poco-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.08
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [
     "dourado"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Thousands of scholars traveled to the capital for the imperial exam.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-nuvens",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.08,
      1.0
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": []
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Zhong Kui walked for weeks, with his best friend, *Du Ping*.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "aldeia_china-jardim",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.12,
      1.26
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "correr",
      "rosto": "sorriso",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.32
     },
     {
      "id": "duping",
      "pose": "correr",
      "rosto": "sorriso",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.68
     }
    ],
    "cartao": {
     "tipo": "nome",
     "titulo": "Du Ping",
     "sub": "his best friend",
     "t0": 0.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "When the results were posted, his name was at the very top.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-colunas",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.3,
      1.15
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "pular",
      "rosto": "sorriso",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.32
     },
     {
      "id": "duping",
      "pose": "triunfo",
      "rosto": "sorriso",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.68
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "He was led into the palace to meet the Emperor himself.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-salao",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.3,
      1.42
     ],
     "x": 0.38,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "andar",
      "rosto": "calmo",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": [
       0.3,
       0.5
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Emperor took one look at his face, and *turned away*.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-salao",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
      1.45
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "imperador",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "A man this ugly cannot be the top scholar of my empire.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-salao",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.2,
      1.32
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.66
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "imperador",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "The title was taken from him, right there, in front of the court.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-colunas",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
      1.45
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "susto",
      "rosto": "triste",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Zhong Kui shouted that it was unjust. The guards drew their swords.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-escada-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.15,
      1.3
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "golpe",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "And in his rage, he threw himself headfirst against the *palace steps*.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-escada-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
      1.45
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "zhongkui",
      "pose": "pular",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "He died on the stone, in front of everyone.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "palacio_ceu-escada-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.08
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [
